          "content": "2026-09-16 · D122 · TOTP · Alta and Códigos opened from the wizard leave the app shell for the wizard's frame; that frame is drawn in onboarding.pen, this file keeps the Ajustes entry\n2026-09-16 · kit 1.0.0 · ButtonPrimary and Field back to the kit's metrics; HeaderBar and BottomNav vendored\n2026-09-16 · D78 · every card mirrored to the code: 30px titles, lg fields and buttons, the wordmark at its h-8 size; 2FA and recovery take one input; Email sent carries the neutral copy, spam line and expiry; Enlace expirado and Contraseña actualizada take the h1 and lg button the code now has\n2026-09-16 · TOTP · Alta and Códigos redrawn in the app shell they render in: no download, a real warning, HeaderBar back\n2026-09-16 · desktop brand panel loses \"Tu patrimonio invertido, en una pantalla.\" — the code never rendered it\n2026-09-16 · new artboard: Login · Error\n2026-09-16 · brief rewritten into its fixed sections; the reasoning it carried lives in ADR-018, D52 and git history\n2026-09-16 · canvas · grid variables declared, bands reflowed\n2026-09-13 · Login (mobile + desktop) drops the terms line — the legal pages are gone, ADR-026 · D118\n2026-09-05 · Enlace expirado and Contraseña actualizada drawn — the reset journey's two endings, AUTH-2\n2026-09-05 · the brief stopped saying 'design-led, code is reference (D8)'; D78 retired that posture\n2026-09-05 · the brief stopped restating the kit version, which read 0.8.0 against a variable saying 0.8.1 (X4)\n2026-09-05 · this file adopted the Log frame; the brief's three dated lines moved here\n2026-08-27 · ADR-018 supersedes D23 — TOTP with recovery codes is built, and the brief had called it settled while nothing existed\n2026-08-27 · D52 · the product asks for enrollment in BOTH the first-boot wizard and Ajustes\n2026-08-27 · Panel · V1…V4 moved to _playground.pen — moved, not deleted: they are the reasoning",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
